ng the process hang for seconds and allocate heaps of memory. Versions 5.0.5, 3.0.2, 2.0.3, and 1.1.13 fix the issue. As a workaround, sanitize strings passed to `expand()` to ensure a step value of `0` is not used.", cvssVector: "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H", reference: "https://guide.sonatype.com/component/npm/brace-expansion/2.0.2?utm_source=node&utm_medium=integration", }, scanId: "6909c9a3-8e23-4230-98d2-92f60f4f9967", },
